    "reviews": "\u201cI really liked Hyper-5. It is a wonderful celebration of the classic shoot \u2019em up genre, while adding enough modern polish to make it its own thing too.\u201d<br>Little Bits of Gaming<br><br>\u201cHyper-5 gets two thumbs up from me. Fantastic visuals, massively replayable\u201d<br>Vulgar Knight<br><br>\u201cA shmup through and through, but it also plays as a cinematic masterpiece!\u201d<br>Beta Tested, Game Reviewed<br>",
